# ── Source material ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Inputs we work from, not things we deploy. The originals live in
# ../tooke-lab-archive/ — see README §"Where the originals went". Everything here
# is either regenerable (structures, via scripts/download-structures.sh) or must
# be backed up separately (the original photos).
#
# Keeping these out of the repo matters: Cloudflare Pages clones the whole
# repository on every build.
source/

# Never commit the decks. They are ~450MB and belong in the archive folder.
*.pptx
~$*

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# build.sh stages the deployable site here. Cloudflare rebuilds it on every
# deploy, so a committed copy would only ever be stale.
_site/

# ── OS / editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Claude Code session state and worktrees. .claude/worktrees/ holds nested git
# repositories; committing one would embed a broken half-repo that clones cannot
# resolve.
.claude/
